message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "InsightToast"
abstract: >-
  Real-time multi-agentic RAG pipeline and mixed-initiative interface that
  monitors verbal discourse, detects topics and informational needs as they
  emerge, and proactively retrieves and surfaces source-grounded insights
  as glanceable text and interactive charts.
